    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 A creature of the Land Dragon Antharas, entrusted to protect the Dragon Dungeon, and slay any trespassers who might wake the Land Dragon from his deep slumber. His body is stained with the blood of the many intruders he has killed, and so he is called Bloody Priest Rudelto. Demons Lv. 9 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Demons. M. Atk. +10 Atk. Spd. +5% Vampiric Rage effect +1% Bow Skill Vampiric Rage effect +2% Resistance to Dark +10% P. Def. -5% Resistance to Holy -10% Resistance to Blunt -10% Resistance to Dual Blunt -10% Dark Attack Lv. 1 Unleashes a dark attack. Dark Attack Resistance Lv. 5 Resistant to Dark attacks. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
